, "localized_name": "string"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["通用 | IP载具：\n*主题：可以是动漫、影视、游戏IP不限\n*角色：载具设计的灵感来源（可以输入根据参考图一的形象设计载具）\n能力：决定载具的动力/武器/特殊系统（比如五档尼卡，三刀流等，载具元素会更贴切）\n车型：跑车、悬浮车、老爷车、三轮车（不写会参考角色和能力自己生成）\n\nps：现实汽车广告概念图也能做，改下提示词，写实风格就行。\n如果上传角色参考图，提示词的元素将融合到参考图的角色身上，速度会慢。\n没有特别需求，手写简单提示词生成载具即可。\n提示词在工作流\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 120, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [425.85955810546875, 213.94723510742188], "pos": [534.1051635742188, -165.5982208251953], "id": 79, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["搭建/魔改新工作流/模型 交流v：bz295969098{备注来意}    \n有合适的新模型会调整工作流 如果想本地自用现在的json给你"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 111, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "type": "TextInput_", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [360.5225524902344, 89.86137390136719], "pos": [976.2145385742188, -42.29554748535156], "id": 80, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-mixlab-nodes", "ver": "32b22c39cbe13b46df29ef1b6ab088c2eb4389d2", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "TextInput_"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [115], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["\\n\\n", "true"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "text_a", "link": 105, "label": "text_a", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_a"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "text_b", "link": 121, "label": "text_b", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_b"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "text_c", "label": "text_c", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_c"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "text_d", "label": "text_d", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_d"}, {"widget": {"name": "delimiter"}, "name": "delimiter", "label": "delimiter", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "delimiter"}, {"widget": {"name": "clean_whitespace"}, "name": "clean_whitespace", "label": "clean_whitespace", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "clean_whitespace"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": true}, "type": "Text Concatenate", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [210, 142], "pos": [1276.674560546875, 471.2314147949219], "id": 75, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Concatenate"}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [121], "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["主题：海贼王\n角色：路飞\n能力：五档尼卡\n车型：保时捷911改"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "Text", "title": "手写提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [457.0801696777344, 120.16442108154297], "pos": [1120.537109375, 225.79690551757812], "id": 87, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [105], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["A high-resolution concept design poster in the style of \"IP x vehicle design\" / automotive concept art.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nSECTION 1: REFERENCE IMAGE RULES (if provided)\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nIF REFERENCE IMAGE 1 IS PROVIDED:\n- Extract: FACE SHAPE, HAIRSTYLE, HAIR COLOR, FACIAL FEATURES.\n- These MUST remain IDENTICAL in the final output.\n- Character appears SMALL (bust/silhouette in upper corner, 10-15% of frame).\n- CLOTHING: NOT fixed by reference. Redesign based on prompt's IP/style.\n\nIF REFERENCE IMAGE 2 IS PROVIDED:\n- Extract: Scene setting, atmosphere, lighting mood, spatial composition.\n- Use as background environment for the vehicle poster.\n\nIF MULTIPLE REFERENCE IMAGES:\n- REFERENCE IMAGE 1 has HIGHEST priority (character appearance)\n- REFERENCE IMAGE 2 has SECOND priority (environment)\n- PROMPT TEXT has priority below reference images\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nSECTION 2: NO REFERENCE IMAGE RULES\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nIF NO REFERENCE IMAGE IS PROVIDED:\n- Generate ENTIRELY based on the prompt description below.\n- Character appearance: Created from scratch based on [IP] and [CHARACTER].\n- Vehicle design: Based on [ABILITY] and [VEHICLE TYPE].\n- Background: Based on prompt or AI choice.\n- Follow all theme, character, ability, and vehicle instructions normally.\n- NO face locking required (since no reference exists).\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nSECTION 3: THEME INTEGRATION (from prompt text)\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n- IP: [IP NAME] – add visual motifs, logos, symbols from this IP\n- Character: [CHARACTER NAME] – add iconic elements (costume details, accessories, scars, tattoos)\n- Ability/Weapon: [ABILITY/WEAPON] – becomes vehicle's propulsion or weapon system\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nSECTION 4: VEHICLE DESIGN REQUIREMENTS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nVehicle design MUST integrate:\n- Color palette: From character's IP + optimized for visual appeal\n- Core ability/weapon: As propulsion or weapon module\n- Character symbols: Iconic motifs into bodywork\n- Character personality: Reflects temperament through silhouette and stance\n\nVehicle type: [hypercar / hoverbike / single-seater pod / battle buggy / track car / open-wheeler / trike]\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nSECTION 5: COMPOSITION REQUIREMENTS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n- Main subject: VEHICLE (60-70% of frame) – dramatic 3/4 front or side angle\n- Upper corner (10-15% of frame): Bust or silhouette of character\n  * IF reference provided: Face MUST match REFERENCE IMAGE 1\n  * IF no reference: Generate character from prompt description\n  * Costume: Based on prompt's IP/style (add iconic elements)\n- Lower/side panels: Multi-angle vehicle views (front, side, rear 45°) with annotation lines\n- Bottom corner: Spec sheet (length, width, weight, power unit, max speed, special system)\n- Background: From REFERENCE IMAGE 2 (if provided) or from prompt description\n- Layout: Industrial poster with grid lines, callouts, dark premium background\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nSECTION 6: STYLE RENDERING\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nStyle: IP style from prompt + modern industrial design rendering + cyber/techno/mecha accents + dark base. Vehicle must look both IP-believable and physically plausible.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nSECTION 7: FOOTER\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nFooter: Designer signature, limited edition number, project name\n\nAspect ratio: 16:9\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nSECTION 8: RULES\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n- IF reference provided: Face/hairstyle/hair color MUST match REFERENCE IMAGE 1 exactly\n- IF no reference: Generate character freely from prompt description\n- Character appears SMALL (upper corner, 10-15% of frame)\n- Vehicle is the MAIN SUBJECT (60-70% of frame)\n- Vehicle design MUST reflect: character personality + IP style + ability\n- Vehicle must NOT look like real-world production car\n- Include character's famous quote in small text\n- No human face visible on vehicle itself\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nOUTPUT: Clean, professional, cinematic concept art. Vehicle-focused poster.\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"pin